# Files and directories that never reach the Web Store zip.
#
# One glob per line, matched against paths inside dist/. `#` starts a comment; blank lines
# are ignored. As in .gitignore, a pattern with no `/` matches at any depth, so `AGENTS.md`
# also covers `assets/AGENTS.md`; a pattern containing a `/` is anchored to dist/.
#
# Everything else in dist/ ships, source maps included: they are built on purpose
# (sourcemap: true in both vite configs) so reviewers can read the published code.
# Do not add `*.map` here without deciding to stop publishing them.

